00:18:22.370 --> 00:18:23.120
Right.

00:18:24.420 --> 00:18:24.920
Jamie!

00:18:24.920 --> 00:18:25.790
Right!

00:18:28.380 --> 00:18:29.880
Okui, let's move!

00:18:45.270 --> 00:18:46.450
Hey, Tokimune.

00:18:46.450 --> 00:18:47.110
