00:21:15.290 --> 00:21:16.620
No idea.

00:21:33.460 --> 00:21:34.830
Wait for me.

00:21:40.730 --> 00:21:41.580
Yes.

00:21:51.990 --> 00:21:53.710
Hey, you're here.

00:21:59.260 --> 00:22:00.720
Come in.

00:23:38.650 --> 00:23:40.360
